.claude/

# Security working documents — deliberately NOT published.
# This repo is public. The threat model enumerates the app's trust boundaries
# and, more to the point, the risks still OPEN against a live deployment; that
# is a prioritised target list for anyone who reads it. Fixed code is safe to
# publish (a closed hole helps nobody); the list of open ones is not.
# Keep it local, or move it somewhere private. See scripts/verify-prod.mjs for
# the parts that are safe to share.
docs/THREAT_MODEL.md

# Business-strategy working documents — deliberately NOT published.
# This repo is public. Pricing assumptions, conversion models, capital and
# exit thinking are internal; they were tracked here until 2026-09-08 and
# were untracked (git rm --cached) the same day. They stay on disk for the
# founders. History before that commit still contains them — rotate the
# repo to private, or rewrite history, if that matters.
STRATEGY.md
REMEDIATION_ROADMAP.txt
docs/strategy/

# /brag launch-video output (local renders, not shipped)
brag-output*/
